{"timestamp": 1779345558.8032389, "event_type": "free_roam_chat", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "name": "Eve", "room": "electrical", "message": "I'm going medbay for scan, want to stick together?", "tick": 6}}
{"timestamp": 1779345563.554202, "event_type": "player_moved", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "from": "weapons", "to": "security"}}
{"timestamp": 1779345569.0900779, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 6, "data": {"caller": "player_1", "reason": "Bob reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Diana"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779345569.090915, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 6, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779345588.3393412, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I reported Diana in medbay, right by scan. I came down from cafeteria after passing oxygen/caf, and when I got into medbay Diana was already down. Eve was coming in from electrical side and Frank came in from storage side basically at the same time, so I hit report immediately.\n\nI didn\u2019t see the actual kill animation, but the only people I saw there were Eve and Frank with me. Alice/Charlie weren\u2019t around medbay from what I saw. We should hear where Eve and Frank came from before this."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345612.667935, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I don\u2019t have much to add on the body. My route was cafeteria to weapons, and I haven\u2019t encountered anyone at all this round \u2014 didn\u2019t see Diana, Bob, Eve, Frank, or Charlie.\n\nSo I\u2019m not near medbay and can\u2019t clear anyone. Bob\u2019s report puts the body in medbay with Eve coming from electrical and Frank from storage, so I think the important info is exactly where Eve and Frank were before that and whether either of them can account for their timing. I\u2019d also like Charlie\u2019s route since I haven\u2019t seen them either."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345628.015927, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I came from storage toward medbay. I didn\u2019t see anyone in storage or on the way up, and I definitely didn\u2019t see the kill happen. When I got into medbay the report happened basically immediately, so from my perspective Diana was already dead by scan and Bob/Eve were the only people I saw there at that moment.\n\nBob is right that I came from the storage side. I can\u2019t clear Bob or Eve because I arrived too late to see anything, and nobody can really clear me except my route being storage straight to medbay. I think we need Eve\u2019s exact path/timing from electrical and Charlie\u2019s route. If Charlie was nowhere near medbay, then the main people with opportunity are probably the three of us in/entering medbay, unless it was an older kill."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345653.377763, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I came from security into electrical. Charlie entered electrical from security around tick 4 and was still there with me through ticks 5 and 6. I was coming from the electrical side toward medbay when the report happened, but I did not see the kill or Diana alive/dead before the report pulled us.\n\nSo Charlie should be able to confirm I was in electrical basically right before this. If Charlie confirms that, then I don\u2019t think I had time to kill Diana by scan and be \u201ccoming in\u201d at the same moment Bob reported.\n\nFrom the info so far, Alice sounds far away in weapons, Charlie was with me in electrical, so the main suspicion is between Bob and Frank \u2014 Bob could be a self-report, or Frank came from storage with no witness. I want to hear Charlie\u2019s route/confirmation before deciding, but I\u2019m leaning that the vote should be on Bob or Frank, not me."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345676.031546, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I can confirm most of Eve\u2019s story. My route was weapons \u2192 security \u2192 electrical. I saw Eve in electrical at tick 4 and tick 5, and I was still in electrical when the report happened. I did not see Diana at all, and I didn\u2019t see Bob, Frank, or Alice this round.\n\nSo from my perspective, Eve was with me basically right before the report, and I think that makes her much less likely unless the kill happened literally at the doorway in the final moment, which doesn\u2019t match Bob saying Diana was already down by scan.\n\nThat leaves Bob and Frank as the main suspects to me. Bob could be a self-report coming from cafeteria/medbay, or Frank could have killed coming from storage with no witness. I don\u2019t have enough to hard clear either. If we vote, I\u2019d vote between Bob and Frank, but I\u2019m not 100% sure which one."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345700.575913, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I get why it\u2019s between me and Frank, but from my view Frank is the only one with no one placing him before medbay. Eve being confirmed in electrical by Charlie makes me trust her more here.\n\nI came down into medbay and the body was by scan \u2014 I reported as Eve/Frank were entering because obviously if I don\u2019t report with people walking in, that looks terrible. If I were self-reporting, doing it right as two people arrive from different doors is a really bad time to choose.\n\nFrank\u2019s route is just \u201cstorage to medbay\u201d with no witness, so if we\u2019re voting between us, I think Frank is the better vote. If people aren\u2019t comfortable, I can understand a skip, but I don\u2019t think Eve is the vote after Charlie\u2019s confirmation."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345721.759545, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I\u2019m still clear of the scene \u2014 I was cafeteria to weapons and saw nobody, so I can\u2019t directly vouch for anyone or dispute the medbay timing.\n\nBased on what everyone said, Eve and Charlie seem paired in electrical right before the report, so I\u2019m not voting Eve. That really leaves Bob versus Frank. Bob is unconfirmed too, but the report timing with Eve and Frank arriving makes me think a self-report is a bit less likely. Frank coming from storage with no witness is the weakest route right now.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Frank if we vote, but I\u2019m not pretending it\u2019s 100%."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345745.161199, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I understand why my route looks weak because I was alone in storage, but I\u2019m a goose and I did not kill Diana. I came straight from storage into medbay and the report hit basically as I arrived \u2014 I didn\u2019t get time to see anything except Bob and Eve there.\n\nThe thing I want to point out is Bob being reporter doesn\u2019t clear him. If Bob killed and then saw Eve and me entering from different sides, reporting immediately is exactly what he\u2019d have to do before one of us reported it. So \u201cbad self-report timing\u201d doesn\u2019t really clear him to me.\n\nEve and Charlie seem paired, Alice is away, so yes it\u2019s between Bob and me. From my perspective, Bob is the only person who was actually in position to have found or created the body before the rest of us arrived. I\u2019d rather skip if people aren\u2019t sure, but if it\u2019s between us, I\u2019m voting Bob because I know it wasn\u2019t me."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345772.5722308, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I don\u2019t have anything new beyond Charlie confirming me in electrical, but that confirmation is important: I was in electrical with Charlie right before report, so I really don\u2019t think I could\u2019ve killed Diana at scan and then been \u201centering from electrical\u201d at the same time Bob reported.\n\nSo I\u2019m taking Alice/Charlie as away or accounted for, and I\u2019m not considering myself. That leaves Bob and Frank.\n\nBetween those two, I agree Frank\u2019s route is the weakest: storage to medbay alone, no witness, arriving from the side closest to the body timing-wise. Bob being reporter doesn\u2019t hard clear him, and a self-report is possible, but I think Frank has less support and more opportunity from the info we have.\n\nI\u2019m leaning vote Frank. If the last speaker has a strong reason to skip I\u2019ll listen, but right now Frank is my best vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345784.6433191, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 6, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "After hearing everyone, I\u2019m still on the same read: Eve is very unlikely here because I was with her in electrical right before the report. I didn\u2019t see her leave early enough to get to medbay scan, kill Diana, and then be described as coming in from electrical.\n\nAlice is far from the body by her claim, and nobody has contradicted that, so the real pool is Bob and Frank.\n\nBetween those two, I think Frank looks worse. Bob could be self-reporting, but he reported with people arriving from both sides, and Frank\u2019s route is completely unwitnessed from storage into medbay. Frank also had the weakest alibi and was entering from a direction where nobody can place him before the body.\n\nI\u2019m not saying it\u2019s 100%, but if we\u2019re voting, I think Frank is the best vote."}}
